note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, 770G.00/12–1560. Secret; Priority;
                    Limit Distribution. Drafted by Herz; cleared by Satterthwaite, White, and
                    Bohlen; and approved by Hare. Sent priority to London, Bonn, Tunis, and Lagos;
                    repeated to Paris, Brussels, Cairo, Khartoum, Léopoldville, Moscow, and USUN;
                    and pouched to 9 other African missions.
